#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:118
msgid "MNA — nutritional status"
msgstr "MNA — voedingstoestand"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:120
msgid ""
"The **MNA** (Mini Nutritional Assessment, short form) screens for "
"**malnutrition risk** out of **14 points**, from 6 questions:"
msgstr ""
"De **MNA** (Mini Nutritional Assessment, korte vorm) screent het **risico op"
" ondervoeding** op **14 punten**, aan de hand van 6 vragen:"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:123
msgid "Reduced food intake over the past 3 months (0-2)"
msgstr "Verminderde voedselinname over 3 maanden (0-2)"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:124
msgid "Recent weight loss (0-3)"
msgstr "Recent gewichtsverlies (0-3)"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:125
msgid "Mobility (0-2)"
msgstr "Mobiliteit (0-2)"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:126
msgid "Acute illness / psychological stress (0 or 2)"
msgstr "Acute ziekte / psychologische stress (0 of 2)"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:127
msgid "Neuropsychological problems (0-2)"
msgstr "Neuropsychologische problemen (0-2)"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:128
msgid "Body mass index — BMI (0-3)"
msgstr "Body Mass Index — BMI (0-3)"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:63
msgid "12-14"
msgstr "12-14"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:63
msgid "8-11"
msgstr "8-11"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:63
msgid "At risk of malnutrition"
msgstr "Risico op ondervoeding"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:63
msgid "0-7"
msgstr "0-7"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:63
msgid "Malnourished"
msgstr "Ondervoed"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:136
msgid "Nutritional follow-up"
msgstr "Voedingsopvolging"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:139
msgid ""
"Malnutrition follow-up (MNA re-scoring reminders, intake vs needs, "
"hydration) relies on the clinical registers and the care module. See [The "
"clinical registers](../soins/registres.md)."
msgstr ""
"De opvolging van ondervoeding (herinneringen om de MNA opnieuw te scoren, "
"inname vs behoeften, hydratatie) steunt op de klinische registers en de "
"zorgmodule. Zie [De klinische registers](../soins/registres.md)."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:144
msgid "OHAT — oral health"
msgstr "OHAT — mondgezondheid"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:146
msgid ""
"The **OHAT** (Oral Health Assessment Tool) assesses **oral health** across "
"**8 categories**, scored from 0 (healthy) to 2 (needs treatment): lips, "
"tongue, gums and tissues, saliva, natural teeth, dentures, oral cleanliness "
"and dental pain."
msgstr ""
"De **OHAT** (Oral Health Assessment Tool) beoordeelt de **mondgezondheid** "
"in **8 categorieën**, gescoord van 0 (gezond) tot 2 (te behandelen): lippen,"
" tong, tandvlees en weefsels, speeksel, natuurlijke tanden, prothesen, "
"mondhygiëne en tandpijn."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:151
msgid ""
"The total ranges from 0 to 16. **Here, the higher the score, the more "
"concerning the situation.**"
msgstr ""
"Het totaal loopt van 0 tot 16. **Hier geldt: hoe hoger de score, hoe "
"zorgwekkender de situatie.**"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:136
msgid "Oral health status"
msgstr "Mondgezondheid"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:136
msgid "0-3"
msgstr "0-3"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:136
msgid "Healthy"
msgstr "Gezond"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:136
msgid "4-8"
msgstr "4-8"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:136
msgid "Changes needed (refer to a dental professional)"
msgstr "Aanpassingen nodig (verwijzen naar een tandheelkundige)"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:136
msgid "9-16"
msgstr "9-16"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:136
msgid "Unhealthy (urgent referral)"
msgstr "Ongezond (dringende verwijzing)"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:160
msgid "« N/A » options"
msgstr "« N/A »-opties"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:163
msgid ""
"The **Natural teeth** and **Dentures** categories have an **N/A** (not "
"applicable) option: it is excluded from the total score calculation."
msgstr ""
"De categorieën **Natuurlijke tanden** en **Prothesen** hebben een "
"**N/A**-optie (niet van toepassing): die wordt uitgesloten van de "
"totaalscore."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:167
msgid "Tinetti — balance, gait and fall risk"
msgstr "Tinetti — evenwicht, gang en valrisico"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:169
msgid ""
"The **Tinetti** scale (POMA) assesses **balance** and **gait** to estimate "
"**fall risk**:"
msgstr ""
"De **Tinetti-schaal** (POMA) beoordeelt het **evenwicht** en de **gang** om "
"het **valrisico** in te schatten:"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:172
msgid "Balance section: 9 items, /16"
msgstr "Onderdeel Evenwicht: 9 items, /16"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:173
msgid "Gait section: /12"
msgstr "Onderdeel Gang: /12"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:174
msgid "Total: /28"
msgstr "Totaal: /28"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:176
msgid "Resthome calculates the two subscores and the total."
msgstr "Resthome berekent de twee subscores en het totaal."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:160
msgid "Fall risk"
msgstr "Valrisico"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:160
msgid "25-28"
msgstr "25-28"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:160
msgid "Low risk"
msgstr "Laag risico"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:160
msgid "19-24"
msgstr "19-24"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:160
msgid "Under 19"
msgstr "Minder dan 19"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:184
msgid "Tinetti, Morse and the falls register"
msgstr "Tinetti, Morse en het valregister"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:187
msgid ""
"The « Evaluation Tools » tab offers **Tinetti**. For the **Morse** scale and"
" the **falls register** (incidents, preventive measures, reassessments), use"
" the [clinical registers](../soins/registres.md)."
msgstr ""
"Het tabblad « Evaluation Tools » biedt **Tinetti**. Voor de **Morse-schaal**"
" en het **valregister** (incidenten, preventieve maatregelen, her-"
"evaluaties) gebruikt u de [klinische registers](../soins/registres.md)."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:192
msgid "Entering and validating an assessment"
msgstr "Een evaluatie invoeren en valideren"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:194
msgid "All scales follow the same flow:"
msgstr "Alle schalen volgen hetzelfde traject:"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:196
msgid ""
"Open the scale: from the resident's **« Evaluation Tools »** tab, or via "
"**Healthcare > Evaluation Tools**."
msgstr ""
"Open de schaal: vanuit het tabblad **« Evaluation Tools »** van de bewoner, "
"of via **Healthcare > Evaluation Tools**."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:198
msgid ""
"**New**: the resident, the **date** (today by default) and the **assessor** "
"(you) are pre-filled. Score the items."
msgstr ""
"**Nieuw**: de bewoner, de **datum** (standaard vandaag) en de "
"**beoordelaar** (u) worden vooraf ingevuld. Scoor de items."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:200
msgid "**Confirm**: the assessment moves from **Draft** to **Confirmed**."
msgstr "**Bevestigen**: de evaluatie gaat van **Concept** naar **Bevestigd**."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:201
msgid ""
"**Validate**: the head nurse or the physician validates; the assessment "
"moves to **Validated**, with the validator and the validation date recorded."
msgstr ""
"**Valideren**: de hoofdverpleegkundige of de arts valideert; de evaluatie "
"gaat naar **Gevalideerd**, met de validator en de validatiedatum "
"geregistreerd."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:204
msgid ""
"The status bar follows these steps: **Draft → Confirmed → Validated** (plus "
"**Cancelled**). The available buttons are **Confirm**, **Validate**, "
"**Cancel** and **Reset to draft**."
msgstr ""
"De statusbalk volgt deze stappen: **Concept → Bevestigd → Gevalideerd** "
"(plus **Geannuleerd**). De beschikbare knoppen zijn **Bevestigen**, "
"**Valideren**, **Annuleren** en **Terug naar concept**."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:208
msgid "Locking and retention"
msgstr "Vergrendeling en bewaring"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:211
msgid ""
"A **validated** assessment is **locked**: its scores can no longer be "
"edited. To correct it, click **Reset to draft** (restricted to the head "
"nurse). Validated assessments **cannot be deleted**: health data must be "
"retained (GDPR and the country's health-data retention rules)."
msgstr ""
"Een **gevalideerde** evaluatie is **vergrendeld**: de scores kunnen niet "
"meer worden gewijzigd. Om ze te corrigeren, klikt u op **Opnieuw instellen "
"op Concept** (voorbehouden aan de hoofdverpleegkundige). Gevalideerde "
"evaluaties **kunnen niet worden verwijderd**: gezondheidsgegevens moeten "
"bewaard blijven (AVG en de bewaarregels voor gezondheidsgegevens van het "
"land)."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:216
msgid "One assessment per day"
msgstr "Eén evaluatie per dag"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:219
msgid ""
"There can only be **one assessment per resident, per date and per scale**. "
"The date cannot be in the future, and no assessment can be created for a "
"deceased resident."
msgstr ""
"Er kan slechts **één evaluatie per bewoner, per datum en per schaal** "
"bestaan. De datum mag niet in de toekomst liggen en er kan geen evaluatie "
"worden aangemaakt voor een overleden bewoner."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:223
msgid "Follow-up and reassessment"
msgstr "Opvolging en her-evaluatie"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:225
msgid ""
"The « Evaluation Tools » tab keeps the **dated history** of each scale: to "
"reassess, enter a **new assessment** on a new date."
msgstr ""
"Het tabblad « Evaluation Tools » bewaart de **gedateerde geschiedenis** van "
"elke schaal: om te her-evalueren voert u een **nieuwe evaluatie** in op een "
"nieuwe datum."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:227
msgid ""
"The **dependency scale** has its own **renewal cycle** (validity due date, "
"reminders), set by the country pack."
msgstr ""
"De **afhankelijkheidsschaal** heeft een eigen **hernieuwingscyclus** "
"(geldigheidsvervaldatum, herinneringen), bepaald door het landpakket."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:229
msgid ""
"For a structured **periodic reassessment cycle** (calculated due date, keep "
"/ change / stop decision, follow-up log), use the [clinical "
"registers](../soins/registres.md)."
msgstr ""
"Voor een gestructureerde **periodieke her-evaluatiecyclus** (berekende "
"vervaldatum, beslissing behouden / aanpassen / stoppen, opvolgingsjournaal) "
"gebruikt u de [klinische registers](../soins/registres.md)."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:233
msgid "Key points to remember"
msgstr "Kernpunten om te onthouden"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:235
msgid ""
"Five international scales: MMSE, Braden, MNA, OHAT and Tinetti, on the "
"resident's « Evaluation Tools » tab."
msgstr ""
"Vijf internationale schalen: MMSE, Braden, MNA, OHAT en Tinetti, op het "
"tabblad « Evaluation Tools » van de bewoner."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:237
msgid ""
"Score meaning: MMSE and Tinetti, a **high** score = favorable situation; "
"Braden and MNA, a **low** score = more at risk; OHAT, a **high** score = "
"more at risk."
msgstr ""
"Betekenis van de scores: MMSE en Tinetti, **hoge** score = gunstige "
"situatie; Braden en MNA, **lage** score = meer risico; OHAT, **hoge** score "
"= meer risico."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:239
msgid ""
"Common flow: **Draft → Confirmed → Validated**; validation is restricted to "
"the head nurse or the physician."
msgstr ""
"Gemeenschappelijk traject: **Concept → Bevestigd → Gevalideerd**; valideren "
"is voorbehouden aan de hoofdverpleegkundige of de arts."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:241
msgid "Validated = **locked and retained**; reset to draft to correct."
msgstr ""
"Gevalideerd = **vergrendeld en bewaard**; zet terug naar concept om te "
"corrigeren."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:242
msgid "One assessment per resident, per date and per scale."
msgstr "Eén evaluatie per bewoner, per datum en per schaal."

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:244
msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "Meer weten"

#: ../../content/residents/evaluations.md:246
msgid ""
"[The clinical registers](../soins/registres.md) — falls (Morse), restraint, "
"pain, wounds, periodic reassessments."
msgstr ""
"[De klinische registers](../soins/registres.md) — vallen (Morse), fixatie, "
"pijn, wonden, periodieke her-evaluaties."

